                                            <selectedService.icon className="w-6 h-6" />
                                        </div>
                                        <p className="text-gray-600 text-base leading-relaxed font-medium">
                                            {selectedService.desc}
                                        </p>
                                    </div>
                                    <p className="text-gray-500 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                                        At Dwarika Hospital, we are committed to providing world-class {selectedService.title.toLowerCase()} supported by modern technology and compassionate nursing care. Our facility is designed to meet international standards for patient safety and clinical excellence.
